Package: extensionSamplers
Title: Extended Fibre Samplers for Statistical Linear Inverse Problems
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Linus", "Fromm", , "froli465@student.otago.ac.nz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package implements fibre samplers for which a Markov basis cannot be found. As a solution, it samples from an extended fibre (including samples with negative counts). The algorithm is a Metropolis-Hastings algorithm and is described in the accompanying paper.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
